 "description": "SPACIOUS THREE BEDROOM TWO BATHROOM HOUSE \n\nAn excellent opportunity to acquire this extended three-storey property, ideally located in a convenient position close to the city centre. Offering strong potential as a buy-to-let investment or a first-time purchase, the home benefits from uPVC double glazing and gas central heating throughout.\n\nThe accommodation comprises: a front dining room and a separate rear sitting room, a spacious, well-fitted kitchen and a large ground-floor bathroom with full tiling, featuring both a bath and a separate shower area. On the first floor, you’ll find: two well-proportioned bedrooms, a modern, tiled bathroom with shower and the second floor offers a further generous double bedroom.\n\nOutside, the property includes a small front foregarden, side gated access, and a private enclosed rear garden, ideal for outdoor relaxation or entertaining.\n\nThis property combines space, location, and potential – a great choice for investors or first-time buyers alike.",
